  "start": {
   "title": "Restless Tide",
   "text": "A very small dragon is applying for a very ordinary job, and the interviewer will not stop listening. Pick up a crate, barrel or potted fern (E) to hold your breath and BE it. The listener imitates your habits: the same disguise twice, or one it has already inspected, gives you away. Letting go makes noise, and it comes back from a new corner. Fool it three times and it gives up.",
   "button": "Begin"
  },
  "end": {
   "victory": {
    "title": "Hired.",
    "text": "The listener stopped chasing. Start Monday.",
